 pyvpt2/quartic.py                   | 66 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 pyvpt2/tests/test_quartic_routes.py | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pyvpt2/tests/test_quartic_routes.py

